---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '中国小费文化：需要给小费吗？';
const description = 'No, tipping is not expected in China. A quick guide for foreign visitors on what to do (and what not to do) when it comes to tipping.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China Tipping Culture: Do You Need to Tip?
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">简短的回答：不。不要给小费。没人预料到。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读3分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-pink-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-purple-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>不，别给小费。</strong> Tipping is not part of Chinese culture. Service charges are included in the price. Leaving a tip can actually create awkwardness — staff might chase you down to return the money.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Short answer: <strong>不，别给小费。没人预料到，这实际上会造成尴尬。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        This is one of those things that feels wrong if you're from the US or Canada, where tipping is practically a second salary. But in China, the culture is completely different.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🤷</span> The Reality
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Tipping is not part of Chinese service culture. When you try to leave a tip, the reaction is usually confusion or refusal. I've seen waitstaff chase customers down the street to return a tip they left on the table.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        The reason is simple: service charges are included in the price. There's no expectation that you'll add extra.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🤔</span> Does Anyone Tip in China?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">有一些边缘情况：</p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>高端酒店和美食：</strong> Some upscale establishments are used to foreign guests tipping, but it's not expected.</li>
        <li><strong>导游：</strong> A small tip at the end is appreciated but absolutely not required.</li>
        <li><strong>酒店搬运工：</strong> ¥10–20 for carrying bags is fine but optional.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Even in those cases, it's more of a "the tourist is being nice" gesture than a "I need this to make a living" situation.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚫</span> What Not to Do
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li>🚫 不要像回家时那样留下15-20%的小费。这太过分了。</li>
          <li>🚫 不要给出租车司机小费。他们会感到困惑。</li>
          <li>🚫 不要在休闲餐厅、咖啡馆或酒吧给小费。</li>
          <li>🚫 当有人拒绝时，不要坚持。他们真的不想要。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💡</span> What to Do Instead of Tipping
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If you want to show appreciation for good service, a warm "thank you" (<em>谢谢 — xi谢</em>) goes a long way. Or leave a positive review on Dianping (China's Yelp) if you have the app.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900">你付小费省下的钱？把它放在另一顿美餐上。你会有很多美味的食物来消费。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">主要机场的交通选择</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-fails/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">付款失败时该怎么办</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">故障排除指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">VPN服务经常变化。没有单一官方来源。出行前请查询当前推荐。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">在中国，给小费是不习惯的。根据一般旅行礼仪资源编译。</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>